    "diagnosis": "<p>Solid papillary carcinoma associated with invasive carcinoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Nodules devoid of a myoepithelial cell layer with ragged contours create a geographical jigsaw pattern within a desmoplastic stroma or infiltrate the fat.</p>",
